            "review_title": "Review at Hà Thành Bún Chả",
            "review_text": "Vivian L\n3 contributions\n0\nDishonest attendance\nOct 2026 • Couples\nSmall, clean, beautifully decorated restaurant with staff\nGood English communication. However, the food is only at\nmediocre, edible but not delicious: mouth\nThe portion is too small for one person to eat, pork belly\nThe roast is too dry, the broth has a strange smell. The crab rolls and meat patties are not authentically Northern (the rolls don't have a crab flavor, more like Southern spring rolls).\n5-star ratings on Google are inaccurate because\nThe restaurant has a free kumquat tea promotion.\nGive the customer a 5-star review. Furthermore, I don't know how this review I wrote on Google was taken down.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten October 1, 2026",
